01.07645v3","title":null,"url":null},"text":"The following data augmentations were performed during runtime: rotations in [-π, π], horizontal and vertical flips with 50% chance, elastic deformations, and gamma shifts with a factor sampled from [0.5, 2.0] uniformly distributed.","page":null,"char_start":null,"char_end":null,"path":null,"line_start":null,"line_end":null},{"kind":"code","source":{"kind":"repository","id":"https://github.com/bowang-lab/shape-attentive-unet@2b1dcf0faae70bf4d4978fbac13c0d3f7714d97d","title":null,"url":"https://github.com/bowang-lab/shape-attentive-unet"},"text":"        if np.random.random() < 0.5 and gamma_range[0] < 1:\n            gamma = np.random.uniform(gamma_range[0], 1)\n        else:\n            gamma = np.random.uniform(max(gamma_range[0], 1), gamma_range[1])","page":null,"char_start":null,"char_end":null,"path":"data/ac17_dataloader.py","line_start":30,"line_end":33}],"uncertain":false}],"attempts":1}
